title: Presidential Election
subtitle: The second round results have come in...
view-if: year = 1932 and month == 4 and presidential_election_r2_trigger
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: 3
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: pres_election
face-image: img/hindenburg_election.jpg

@pres_election

The first round has ended, with no candidate receiving an absolute majority of votes. [+ nsdap_candidate +]'s results were disappointing to him and his party, [? if not nsdap_candidate = "Hindenburg": but he has chosen to remain as a candidate ?][? if nsdap_candidate = "Hindenburg": resulting in him dropping out and supporting Hindenburg instead ?]. Thälmann has also remained in the running, refusing to back what they view as the lesser evil.

- @final_election: The second round results...

@final_election
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: post_election


@post_election
on-arrival: {!
Q.bvp_votes = Q.bvp_votes / 100;

Q.reactionary_votes = 0;
Q.dvp_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.spd_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.hitler_votes = 0;
Q.thalmann_votes = 0;

// initial phase:
if (Q.nsdap_candidate != Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.hitler_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized;
if (Q.dnf_candidate == Q.nsdap_candidate && Q.dnf_formed) Q.hitler_votes += Q.dnf_normalized;
if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.nsdap_candidate) Q.hitler_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;

Q.thalmann_votes += Q.kpd_normalized;
if (Q.sapd_formed && Q.sapd_candidate == "Thälmann") Q.thalmann_votes += Q.sapd_normalized;

if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
if (Q.z_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.csvd_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.csvd_normalized;
if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.wp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.cnblp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.cnblp_normalized;
if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.kvp_formed) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.kvp_normalized;
if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dnvp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
if (Q.dnf_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dnf_formed) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dnf_normalized;
if (Q.other_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.other_normalized;
if (Q.nsdap_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.nsdap_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized

if (Q.dvp_candidate == "Eckener" || Q.dvp_candidate == "Luther" || Q.dvp_candidate == "Jarres") {
    Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.csvd_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.csvd_normalized;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.wp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.cnblp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.cnblp_normalized;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.kvp_formed) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.kvp_normalized;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.dnvp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
}


if (Q.spd_campaign) {
    Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == spd_candidate) Q.spd_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == spd_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == spd_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == spd_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == spd_candidate) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
}

// if (Q.hindenburg_to_braun_bonus) {
//     Q.hindenburg_votes -= Q.hindenburg_to_braun_bonus;
//     Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.hindenburg_to_braun_bonus;
// }
// if (Q.thalmann_to_braun_bonus) {
//     Q.thalmann_votes -= Q.thalmann_to_braun_bonus;
//     Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.thalmann_to_braun_bonus;
// }

Q.reactionary_votes = Math.round(Q.reactionary_votes*1000)/10;
Q.dvp_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.dvp_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.spd_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.spd_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.hitler_votes = Math.round(Q.hitler_votes*1000)/10;
Q.thalmann_votes = Math.round(Q.thalmann_votes*1000)/10;

Q.reactionary_plurality = 0;
Q.dvp_candidate_plurality = 0;
Q.spd_candidate_plurality = 0;
Q.thalmann_plurality = 0;
Q.hitler_plurality = 0;

// check for plurality
if (Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.dvp_candidate_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.spd_candidate_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.reactionary_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.spd_candidate_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.dvp_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.spd_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.thalmann_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.thalmann_plurality = 1;
} else {
    Q.hitler_plurality = 1;
}
Q.election_round += 1;

// making the vote numbers nicer for the display
Q.reactionary_votes_disp = Q.reactionary_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.dvp_candidate_votes_disp = Q.dvp_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.spd_candidate_votes_disp = Q.spd_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.hitler_votes_disp = Q.hitler_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.thalmann_votes_disp = Q.thalmann_votes.toFixed(1);
!}
go-to: hindenburg_wins if (reactionary_plurality and reactionary_candidate == "Hindenburg"); adenauer_wins if (reactionary_plurality and reactionary_candidate == "Adenauer"); bruning_wins if (reactionary_plurality and reactionary_candidate == "Brüning"); stegerwald_wins if (reactionary_plurality and reactionary_candidate == "Stegerwald"); westarp_wins if (reactionary_plurality and reactionary_candidate == "Westarp"); lettow_vorbeck_wins if (reactionary_plurality and reactionary_candidate == "Lettow-Vorbeck"); eckener_wins if (dvp_candidate_plurality and dvp_candidate == "Eckener"); luther_wins if (dvp_candidate_plurality and dvp_candidate == "Luther"); jarres_wins if (dvp_candidate_plurality and dvp_candidate == "Jarres"); braun_wins if (spd_candidate_plurality and spd_candidate == "Braun"); rosenfeld_wins if (spd_candidate_plurality and spd_candidate == "Rosenfeld"); thalmann_wins if thalmann_plurality; hitler_wins if hitler_plurality

Results:

[? if dvp_candidate == "Eckener": **Hugo** <span style="color: #000000;">**Ec**</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">**ken**</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">**er**</span> - [+ dvp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?][? if dvp_candidate == "Luther": <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**Hans Luther**</span> - [+ dvp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?][? if dvp_candidate == "Jarres": <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**Karl Jarres**</span> - [+ dvp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

<span style="color: var(--kpd-color);">**Thälmann**</span> - [+ thalmann_votes_disp +]%

[? if spd_campaign: [? if spd_candidate == "Braun": <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**Otto Braun**</span> ?][? if spd_candidate == "Rosenfeld": <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**Kurt Rosenfeld**</span> ?] - [+ spd_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if reactionary_candidate == "Hindenburg": <span style="color: #808080;">**Paul von Hindenburg**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Adenauer": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Konrad Adenauer**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Brüning": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Heinrich Brüning**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Stegerwald": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Adam Stegerwald**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Vorbeck": <span style="color: #808080;">**Paul von Lettow-Vorbeck**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Westarp": <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**Kuno von Westarp**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if nsdap_candidate != "Hindenburg": <span style="color: #954B00;">**[+ nsdap_candidate +]**</span> - [+ hitler_votes_disp +]% ?]


@hindenburg_wins
on-arrival: president = "Hindenburg"; president_party = "I"

As expected, the incumbent Hindenburg wins the presidency.

@adenauer_wins
on-arrival: president = "Adenauer"; president_party = z_name; catholics_z += 3; new_middle_z += 5; old_middle_z += 5;

Konrad Adenauer has won the presidency.

@bruning_wins
on-arrival: president = "Brüning"; president_party = z_name; catholics_z += 7;

Heinrich Brüning has won the presidency.

@stegerwald_wins
on-arrival: president = "Stegerwald"; president_party = z_name; catholics_z += 2; new_middle_z += 4; old_middle_z += 4; workers_z += 4;

Adam Stegerwald has won the presidency.

@westarp_wins
on-arrival: president = "Westarp"; president_party = "KVP" if kvp_formed; president_party = dnvp_name if dnvp_left >= 0; new_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; new_middle_dnvp += 7 if  dnvp_left >= 0; old_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; old_middle_dnvp += 7 if  dnvp_left >= 0; rural_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; rural_dnvp += 7 if  dnvp_left >= 0

Count Kuno von Westarp, one of the most famous figures of the nationalist Right, has been elected president.

@lettow_vorbeck_wins
on-arrival: president = "Lettow-Vorbeck"; president_party = "KVP" if kvp_formed; president_party = dnvp_name if dnvp_left >= 0; new_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; new_middle_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0; old_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; old_middle_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0; rural_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; rural_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0

Paul von Lettow-Vorbeck, a nationalist not far different from Hindenburg, has been elected president.

@eckener_wins
on-arrival: president = "Eckener"; president_party = "I"; new_middle_dvp += 7*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 7*(1-dissent)

Nationally renown Zeppelin pilot and independent Hugo Eckener has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, as his victory helps keep the Nazis at bay.

@luther_wins
on-arrival: president = "Luther"; president_party = dvp_name; new_middle_dvp += 8*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); dvp_left += 1;

Hans Luther has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, as his victory helps us boost our popularity.

@jarres_wins
on-arrival: president = "Jarres"; president_party = dvp_name; new_middle_dvp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 8*(1-dissent); dvp_left -= 1;

Karl Jarres has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, as his victory helps us boost our popularity.

@braun_wins
on-arrival: president = "Braun"; president_party = spd_name; workers_spd += 5; old_middle_spd += 3; new_middle_spd += 3; rural_spd += 3; unemployed_spd += 3; pro_republic += 3; spd_left -= 1;

Otto Braun of the [+ spd_name +] has won the presidency. The [+ spd_name +] is jubilant.

@rosenfeld_wins
on-arrival: president = "Braun"; president_party = spd_name; workers_spd += 8; unemployed_spd += 8; socialism += 5; spd_left += 1;

Kurt Rosenfeld of the [+ spd_name +] has won the presidency. The <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">Socialists</span> shall continue their march towards the left.

@thalmann_wins
on-arrival: president = "Thälmann"; president_party = kpd_name;

Ernst Thälmann of the KPD has won the presidency.

- @civil_war: This is civil war.

@hitler_wins
on-arrival: president = nsdap_candidate; president_party = "NSDAP"; chancellor = "Hitler"; chancellor_party = "NSDAP"

[? if nsdap_candidate == "Hitler" : Adolf Hitler of the NSDAP has won the presidency. He wastes no time in consolidating power. ?]
[? if nsdap_candidate != "Hitler" : The NSDAP candidate [+ president +] has won. The first action President [+ president +] takes is inviting Hitler back into Germany, and appointing him chancellor. The Nazis waste no time in consolidating power. ?]

- @hitler_takes_power: What do we do now?

